rows.en:
Ha ha ha...
Don't get so embarrassed.
Now I'm the one getting embarrassed.{p}

That's right.
Turns out a dream about killing is a good dream.
...How'd you know that?{p}

The moment I tried to stand up, something struck the back of my head too.
What...?
What just happened?{p}

Fortune-telling books usually list both the good and the bad, but...
This dream was the one exception.
Turns out a dream about killing is a good dream.{p}

After the fifth death scream echoed out, the room suddenly went quiet.
At the same moment, the lights came on.
The timing was perfect, as if it had all been arranged.{p}

...Something's wrong!
Shindo would never do something that cowardly.
I mean, just a while ago he said he hated cowards......{p}

The moment I tried to stand up, something struck the back of my head too.
What...?
What just happened?{p}
